  "description": "This package contains the Jabra Device Interface Library for .NET.\n \nThe Jabra Device Interface Library for .NET makes it easy to integrate call control for Jabra devices.\nFor documentation, release notes, support, and other information please visit the Jabra Developer Zone on https://developer.jabra.com.",
