  "releaseNotes": "## [4.8.0.12] - 2024-12-02\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for Bluetooth devices connected directly to the host PC. This feature requires support by the Device Connector and is currently only available on Windows. It is currently not supported on ARM processors.\n\n### Security\n\n- Added code signing for bundled dependencies to enhance security and integrity of the application. Binaries are signed with following subject `CN=GN Audio, O=GN Audio, L=Ballerup, S=Capital Region, C=DK`. NuGet package signing certificate remains the same.",
